      "worked": "In 12 days, Anisha can paint 6 houses, Bakari can paint 4 houses and Caleb can paint 3 houses. Together they can paint 13 houses in 12 days.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Time for one house}&=\\frac{12}{6+4+3}\\\\\\text{Time for one house}&=\\frac{12}{13}\\text{ days}.\\end{align*}$$",
